DCI icon placeholder
====================
This file is a placeholder for the DCI (Deepin Customized Icon) format used by
the dde control center settings list (required by Attribute_CanSetting).

Replace this text file with the real binary .dci exported from the deepin icon
toolchain (Designer exports .dci with multi-resolution/dark-light variants).

The build installs it to:
  ${DCC_ICON_INSTALL_DIR} = share/dde-dock/icons/dcc-setting/

and the plugin reports its settings icon via the dcc-setting entry so it can be
toggled in the control center.
